<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal construction sector grows H1 '97.</title>
<headline>Portugal construction sector grows H1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's civil construction and public works sector grew by about 20 percent in the first half of 1997, compared with the same period of 1996, the Association of Construction and Public Works Companies (AECOPS) said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement capacity utilisation was about 80 percent in the first semester, up from 77 percent in the first semester of 1996.</p>
</text>
